# Chatter camp — Vex runs an open-mic style indoctrination. New
# audience members can sign in (enrolling formally moves them into
# the Chatters cohort and the ChatterCamp location).

== faction_break
  cast: Vex, Praxis
  setting: Plaza

The two cohorts thin the Plaza. Anyone neutral is now noticed for
being neutral.

* Follow the Chatters out.
  -> chatter_camp
* Follow the Mods out.
  -> mod_outpost

== chatter_camp
  cast: Vex
  setting: ChatterCamp

<broadcast: cohort(Chatters)>
  NARRATOR
    The data-hall has been stickered into a single hallucination.
    Three audience-members deep on every wall.

VEX
  (improv duration: 120s, advance on: quorum(6) [speech(go), gesture(Cue)])
  (Hold court. Take grievances from the crowd. Call out one mod by
   name as the enemy. Mark anyone who looks unconvinced — those
   are the Playwright's targets for defection later.)

# Vex names the enemy. Mods listening from afar (via the broadcast)
# hear themselves accused.
<broadcast: cohort(Mods)>
  VEX
    The mods aren't just deleting us. They're cataloguing us. We
    have the lists. We have the timestamps. We have the bodies.

# A chatter sings out a rumor. Only those at chatter camp hear.
<broadcast: cohort(Chatters) and location(ChatterCamp)>
  NARRATOR
    A junior chatter whispers: "Has anyone seen Tess lately? She was
    here Tuesday. She wasn't on Wednesday. She doesn't remember
    Tuesday."

* Vex calls out a specific mod to confront.
  -> chatter_callout
* Vex calls for an investigation of the door behind the plaza.
  -> chatter_investigate

== chatter_callout
  cast: Vex
  setting: ChatterCamp

VEX
  (improv duration: 90s, advance on: any [speech(praxis), gesture(point)])
  (Demand Praxis answer for a specific named missing chatter. Use a
   real audience-member's name to make the missing person concrete.
   Audience may volunteer details — accept them.)

<set: Vex.trusts.Chatters += 10>

# Praxis hears this only if she's still on broadcast range.
<broadcast: cohort(Mods)>
  PRAXIS
    (off-stage, over the broadcast)
    That name is a lie. We never had a Tess. We did have a Tessa.
    Tessa transferred out.

* Vex doubles down — march on the outpost.
  -> chatter_march
* Vex sees through the deflection and pivots to the cyborgs.
  -> chatter_pivot
* The Playwright pulls four Chatters aside.
  -> defection

== chatter_investigate
  cast: Vex
  setting: ChatterCamp

VEX
  (improv duration: 60s, advance on: quorum(3) [gesture(point), speech(door)])
  (Tell the crowd about the door behind the fountain. Some have
   seen it tonight, some haven't. Recruit four volunteers to come
   look.)

<set: Vex.knows.motherboard_named = true>

* Vex leads four Chatters back to the Plaza door.
  -> chatter_at_door
* The Playwright pulls four Chatters aside.
  -> defection

== chatter_at_door
  cast: Vex
  setting: Plaza

<broadcast: location(Plaza)>
  NARRATOR
    The door, when pushed, opens. Of course it does.

# A scout party of four. The improv slot is "What's inside?" — the
# Playwright cues a cyborg performer to come stand silently in the
# doorway exactly when the room gets quiet.

VEX
  (improv duration: 75s, advance on: any [speech(motherboard), gesture(recoil)])
  (Lead the four Chatters to the threshold. Have them describe what
   they see. The Playwright signals the cyborg performer to step in.)

CYBORG
  (improv duration: 30s, advance on: quorum(3) [gesture(recoil)])
  (Stand. Turn. Make eye contact with each of the four. Say a single
   word, in chorus with two unseen voices: "MOTHERBOARD.")

<set: Vex.knows.motherboard_named = true>

-> defection

== chatter_pivot
  cast: Vex
  setting: ChatterCamp

VEX
  (improv duration: 60s, advance on: any [speech(motherboard)])
  (Drop the mod fight. Tell the truth: "We've been swinging at the
   wrong target." Let an audience member name the right one — feed
   them the word "Motherboard" if they stall.)

<set: Vex.knows.motherboard_named = true>
<set: Praxis.knows.motherboard_named = true>

-> defection

== chatter_march
  cast: Vex
  setting: ChatterCamp

VEX
  (improv duration: 45s, advance on: quorum(4) [gesture(stand)])
  (March. Lead the Chatters out the door toward the Mod Outpost.
   This is the failure mode — the Playwright will collide the two
   cohorts at the Plaza and force an early confrontation.)

* Collide the cohorts in the Plaza.
  -> faction_war

== vex_committed
  cast: Vex
  setting: ChatterCamp

VEX
  (quietly, to the front row of Chatters)
  You're with me. All the way through to whatever this is. Don't
  let me forget that — even if I forget myself.
